---
// Move 3 — one map instead of a blind grep.
---
<figure class="figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 300" role="img" aria-label="Before: an agent greps through many files and gets a wrong answer. After: it reads one index and gets the right one.">
    <g class="sv">
      <!-- divider -->
      <line class="sv-rule" x1="360" y1="20" x2="360" y2="280" />
      <text class="sv-chip" x="30" y="30">before · grep</text>
      <text class="sv-chip" x="392" y="30">after · one file read</text>

      <!-- BEFORE: tangle -->
      <rect class="sv-agent" x="30" y="130" width="90" height="38" rx="19" />
      <text class="sv-mono sv-on-dark" x="75" y="154" text-anchor="middle">agent</text>
      <g>
        <rect class="sv-mini" x="240" y="52"  width="84" height="30" rx="6" />
        <rect class="sv-mini" x="240" y="96"  width="84" height="30" rx="6" />
        <rect class="sv-mini" x="240" y="140" width="84" height="30" rx="6" />
        <rect class="sv-mini" x="240" y="184" width="84" height="30" rx="6" />
        <rect class="sv-mini" x="240" y="228" width="84" height="30" rx="6" />
      </g>
      <path class="sv-path" d="M 122 140 C 180 90 200 130 238 67" />
      <path class="sv-path" d="M 122 146 C 170 190 205 80 238 111" />
      <path class="sv-path" d="M 122 152 C 180 120 200 220 238 155" />
      <path class="sv-path" d="M 122 158 C 170 130 210 260 238 199" />
      <path class="sv-path-rust" d="M 122 164 C 180 240 205 180 238 243" marker-end="url(#arrow-rust2)" />
      <text class="sv-chip sv-rust" x="150" y="262">"yes, here's the spec" (wrong)</text>

      <!-- AFTER: one hop -->
      <rect class="sv-agent" x="392" y="130" width="90" height="38" rx="19" />
      <text class="sv-mono sv-on-dark" x="437" y="154" text-anchor="middle">agent</text>
      <rect class="sv-index" x="518" y="128" width="106" height="42" rx="8" />
      <text class="sv-mono sv-strong" x="571" y="154" text-anchor="middle">index.json</text>
      <path class="sv-path-pine" d="M 484 149 L 514 149" marker-end="url(#arrow-pine2)" />
      <text class="sv-chip sv-pine-t" x="392" y="216">"kind: reference — not built,</text>
      <text class="sv-chip sv-pine-t" x="392" y="236">not promised. skipping."</text>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <marker id="arrow-rust2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--rust)" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="arrow-pine2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--pine)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    “Is feature X built?” stops being a treasure hunt. One generated map, cheap enough to read
    whole, with every file's badge in it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
